      "act": "ASK",
      "narration_text": "Hey, I'm Muskan. Your RAG app gave a wrong answer. Was it the retrieval, or the generation? You can't fix what you don't measure, and RAG has two stages to measure. Here are the four numbers that tell you where it broke.",
