    {
      "beat_id": "B01",
      "act": "FRAMEWORK",
      "narration_text": "Start with the shape. A question goes in. First, retrieval finds the chunks it thinks are relevant. Then generation writes an answer from those chunks. Two stages, two failure points, so you grade them separately.",
