      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "GENERATION",
      "narration_text": "Then grade generation. Answer relevance: does the answer actually address the question? Faithfulness: is every claim backed by the retrieved context, or did the model invent it? These are usually scored by a second model, an LLM acting as judge.",
